{"seq":19,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-05-vantorre-tickets/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:59:43.481Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"5c841a55346dc3c9101a8202ffd622d6fcd822a9cf359a55bcf918149c13e69f","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Nadia, I found 7 Vantorre Group tickets (Vantorre Mobility excluded). Sources are below. #8841 shows up three times with different descriptions, so please check it in the ticket system before this goes to Mateo.\n\n**Vantorre Group tickets**\n\n1. **#8841**: kiosk tablet browser-cache issue, closed out with support.\n   Source: #strategic-pod, 2026-07-01 09:17, Gideon Sato.\n2. **INC-4821**: Hartford status-page access issue, still open at the time; screenshot attached to the ticket.\n   Source: #inc-vtg-hartford, 2026-08-03 11:08, Gideon Sato.\n3. **VT-55120**: root-cause ticket for the Hartford kiosk outage, with Carrowmere's gateway route finding and reconnect log attached.\n   Source: #inc-vtg-hartford, 2026-10-14 09:00, Gideon Sato.\n4. **PD-8841**: two missed carrier check-ins at Allentown (Gate 4, 2nd shift).\n   Source: `teams/team-strategic/digests/2026-04-27-strategic-digest.md`, Moss.\n5. **#8841**: open gate kiosk timeout at Allentown (Dock Door 12, 2nd shift).\n   Source: `teams/team-strategic/digests/2026-05-04-strategic-digest.md`, Moss.\n6. **#8841**: carrier portal issue where Dock Door 14 can't be selected at the Newark check-in kiosk; escalated to platform engineering.\n   Source: `teams/team-strategic/digests/2026-09-30-strategic-digest.md`, Moss.\n7. **#PD-4418**: `Carrier_Dwell_Summary` export drops timestamps for Dock Door 9 during the 04:00 shift changeover. The digest says \"the account Nadia runs\" without naming it, so it may be another account.\n   Source: `teams/team-strategic/digests/2025-09-15-strategic-digest.md`, Moss.\n\n**Things to check before the steering committee**\n\n- **#8841 conflicts:** the July channel post describes it as closed (kiosk tablets, Allentown). The May digest has it open at Allentown Dock 12. The September digest has it as an escalated Newark Dock 14 portal issue. It may be one ticket that was reused, or several tickets with the same number.\n- **PD-8841 vs #8841:** the April digest uses PD-8841 for the Allentown check-ins, and the May digest uses #8841 for Allentown. These may be the same ticket with different prefixes.\n- **Hartford incident:** the war room doesn't give a ticket number for the incident itself beyond INC-4821 and VT-55120.\n\n**Checked, no Vantorre Group ticket numbers:** the 2025-03-10, 2025-07-07, 2025-12-01 and 2026-08-03 digests, and the strategic cheat sheet. Ticket #4812 (Vantorre Mobility) and #PD-4402 (Quillfeather) were left out.\n\nI only used the pod channel, the Hartford war room and Moss's public Strategic digests. I didn't search all messages or the ticket system, so this is the list of mentions I could see, not a complete ticket history."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
